    pk:evidenceAgainst "1995-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion.py L98–L129: Runtime SHA-256 verification pins only the specimen JPG and scout manifest; the reference JSON digest is recorded, not checked <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/1995-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion.py#L98-L129>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-source-traceability-1>,
