<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Kondo & Asai (1995) Pomacanthus reaction-diffusion stripe insertion & Y-branch unzipping — Morphological realism / specimen match: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The v2 segmentation (row-wise spacing 3.80 mm, primary/secondary prominence 2.65x, bimodal fit r = 0.858; `segment_pomacanthus_specimen`, L997-1097) is kept and the specimen now anchors the new curvilinear geometry: `fit_specimen_concentric_arcs` (L1106-1198) estimates the concentric centre from structure-tensor stripe normals of 767 ridge points (robust least squares, 6 Cauchy reweighting iterations), reads 8 arc radii from the radial histogram and reports the curvature-corrected radial spacing 2.62 mm (CV 0.28) which is, as it must be, below the oblique row-wise 3.80 mm; the fitted circles and centre are drawn on Panel E and the simulated arcs on Panel G are visibly concentric C-arcs like the specimen's. Deductions: ridge points are confined by a hand-traced 12-vertex body polygon (L1100-1104) and only 52 % of them lie within 4 px of a fitted arc with a 4.2 mm gap between the 4th and 5th radii (a probable missed arc) (-4); the 40 mm body-span calibration is still an assumption carried from Pass 2 (-2); simulated arc angular spans are not compared with the measured 31-358 deg spans (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1995-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion.py L1100–L1104: Body ROI is a manually traced polygon; not derived from the image <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/1995-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion.py#L1100-L1104>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-specimen-match-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-specimen-match-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-specimen-match-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

