    rdfs:label "mid-trough inhibitor I_mid at first concentric arc insertion vs zero-activator threshold c_3/|c_2| = 0.7424 inhibitor concentration (model units)" ;
    dct:description "insertion fires ~20% above the zero-activator threshold because diffusive activator supply from the flanking arcs (A_trough ~ 0.05-0.1) and the 0.004 background fluctuations raise the local synthesis before I_mid itself crosses 0.625; the Lean bound is the sufficient (A = 0) condition" ;
    schema:measurementTechnique "minimum of I along the central radial transect between adjacent arcs, sampled every 50 steps during growth; pre-insertion I_mid(s) is strictly decreasing (Spearman rho = -1.000); value is the last pre-insertion sample" ;
    schema:name "mid-trough inhibitor I_mid at first concentric arc insertion vs zero-activator threshold c_3/|c_2|" ;
    schema:unitText "inhibitor concentration (model units)" ;
    schema:value "0.7424" ;
    schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-measurement-mid-trough-inhibitor-i-mid-at-first-concentric-arc-insertion-vs-zero-activator-threshold-c-3-c-2-reference> .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-kondo-pomacanthus-stripe-insertion-measurement-mid-trough-inhibitor-i-mid-at-first-concentric-arc-insertion-vs-zero-activator-threshold-c-3-c-2-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
    dct:source "Kondo & Asai (1995) piecewise-linear synthesis F = max(0, c_1 A + c_2 I + c_3) with A = 0 => insertion iff I < c_3/|c_2| = 0.625 (Lean theorem kondo_asai_1995_curvilinear_mid_trough_threshold_partition)" ;
    schema:value "0.625" .

